    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90493" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτένθ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ </span>(ἡ, <i><span class="en">
			Ael.
			<u>NA</u>
			15.10
		</span></i>), in pl., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>those who
				celebrated the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δορπία</span> (q.v.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφεῖσθαι τοὺς βουλευτὰς . . ἀπὸ τῆς ἡμέρας
				ἧς οἱ π. ἄγουσι πέντε ἡμέρας</span> Decr.
				Att.
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				4.171e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίς εἰμ᾽ ἐγώ; ἡ τῶν π. Δορπία
					καλουμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philyll.
					8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>forestaller, regrater</i>, in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1198
			</span></i> (ubi v. Sch.), <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			Adj., <i>greedy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				39
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ μάλιστα π. [πηλαμύς</span>]
				Id.<u>NA</u> l.c. (Glossed <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προγεύστης</span> by Artemidor. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				4.171b
			</span></i>, cf. ib.c.)</div>
